858630/extras/5fa20bc0c8eb5ad8309adbb3bc039769.mp4?t=1781735555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>An online-exclusive mode to challenge up to 20 players in five parties of four-players each.<br>The five parties start separated but gradually unite with one another as the quest progresses.<br>In the last area of the map, a final showdown against the boss awaits, requiring the combined efforts of all participants.<br>*If the number of participants is insufficient for Boss Raid or Co-Op Quest, NPCs will be added until the total reaches 20.<br><br>- Free Roam<br>An online-exclusive mode where players can freely explore a vast map filled with powerful bosses and treasure chests.<br>Up to 20 players can participate in one map, allowing for one-time adventures with randomly selected players.<br>*Online-exclusive modes can be played solo through matchmaking.", "short_description": "Introducing the 2nd installment for the 10th anniversary of SWORD ART ONLINE! A total of 21 characters from the series join the battle beyond memory—a challenge taken on solo or with friends. Go beyond memory... and Switch!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858630/header.jpg?t=1781735555", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781735555", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781735555", "website": "https://fd.sao-game.jp/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><l